{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06912","headline":"闲斋卧病行药至山馆稍次湖亭二首 二 · 常建","name":"闲斋卧病行药至山馆稍次湖亭二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行药至石壁，东风变萌芽。\n主人门外绿，小隐湖中花。\n时物堪独往，春帆宜别家。\n辞君向沧海，烂熳从天涯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}